        "summary": "Weak intramolecular exchange; ferromagnetic Cu–Gd coupling. χMT rises from 32 cm3 mol−1 K at 300 K to a maximum of 35 cm3 mol−1 K at 7 K, then falls to 32 cm3 mol−1 K at 1.8 K. Curie–Weiss fit (25–300 K): C = 32 cm3 mol−1 K, θ = +1.5 K. No out-of-phase ac peaks; not an SMM. Magnetostructural correlation suggests JCuGd ≈ 3–5 cm−1.",
